{#- The wordmark. The R and both a's are built from plain shapes with their holes filled in: the R is a stem, a solid
   half-circle bowl and a diagonal leg (the same mark as the favicon), each a is a solid circle and a stem.
   The visible name is hidden from screen readers, and the plain name is read out instead. -#}
{%- set ra = '<svg class="brand-a" viewBox="0 0 28.5 26.5" focusable="false"><circle cx="13.25" cy="13.25" r="13.25"/><rect x="18.5" width="8" height="26.5"/></svg>' -%}
<span class="sr">{{ site.name }}</span><span class="brand-word" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="brand-r" viewBox="17 14 33 36" focusable="false"><path d="M17 14H34A10 10 0 0 1 34 34H39L48 50H39L30 34H25V50H17Z"/></svg>{{ ra | safe }}n Cr{{ ra | safe }}ycr{{ ra | safe }}ft</span>
